			(property "Description" "USB TYPE A UP RIGHT THT - SHORT TYPE\n\n=>ConUSB2 614004190021\n\nCharacteristics\n\nINSULATOR:PBT\nFLAMMABILITY RATING: UL94-V0\nCOLOR: WHITE\nCONTACT PLATING: GOLD OVER Ni\nCOVER MATERIAL: BRASS\nCOVER PLATING: Ni\nQUALITY CLASS: 15000 MATING CYCLES\nOPERATING TEMPERATURE:-40°C UP TO +85°C\nCOMPLIANCE: LEAD FREE AND ROHS\n\nELECTRICAL\n\nCURRENT RATING:\n- PIN 1 & PIN 4: 3A\n- OTHER PINS: 0,5A\nWORKING VOLTAGE: 30 VAC MAX\nWITHSTANDING VOLTAGE: 500 VAC/MIN\nINSULATION RESISTANCE: > 1000 MΩ\nCONTACT RESISTANCE: 30 mΩ MAX\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/Family_WR-COM_614004190021_4C.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/em/COM_2_0_THT_TYPE_A_HORIZONTAL/614004190021? http://katalog.we-online.de/en/em/COM_2_0_THT_TYPE_A_HORIZONTAL/614004190021?\n2015 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
